claude: true
prompt: |
  You are working on Alien::TinyCDB, an Alien::Base distribution that provides
  Michael Tokarev's TinyCDB (corpit.ru cdb) C library to Perl. Read
  .claude/rules/alien-tinycdb-rules.md, then pick the top actionable ticket from
  the karr board and drive it to review. Delegate behavior-relevant work (the
  dist.ini alien_* build config, lib/Alien/TinyCDB.pm, t/) to alien-tinycdb-worker.
  Never run dzil release.
